st list of the new film since  the characters will once again be very  young we will see a fair number of  newcomers though there will also be some  familiar Hollywood stars  the first protagonist is Lucy graybeard  like Katniss she is from District 12 and  was chosen as tribute for the 10th  Hunger Games what is unique about this  is her love affair with coriolana snow  yes that's right snow the latter  eventually becomes the infamous  President Snow Lucy loves to produce  music with her band Covey and this  Talent also helps her to find Rich  sponsors for The Hunger Games the role  of Lucy is played by Rachel zegler the  21 year old actress made her big  breakthrough in Hollywood in the part of  Maria in the musical film West Side  Story in 2021 whether or not she will  survive the Hunger Games it's something  we won't reveal here of course  however not everything will be about  Lucy one more main character is the  aforementioned coriolana snow the future  Tyrant was not always as cold-hearted  and brutal as in the past installments  snow is a mere 18 years old during the  movie's time and his cousin describes  him as a compassionate and kind-hearted  person yet he quickly realizes his  ability to figure out people and starts  to use this to his Advantage proof that  life scarred him at a young age can be  seen in the fact that his father died in  the Civil War and that his mother also  passed away a short time after thus he  and his sister grew up as orphans and he  was required to take responsibility for  others from an early age his name  coriolanus is by the way a reference to  the Roman general neus marcius  coriolanus like snow he gained his power  through dishonest means and lost it by  his own arrogance the role of snow is  played by Tom Blythe the young actor was  last seen in the film benediction and  also counts as a newcomer in Hollywood  we are particularly looking forward to  meeting the creator of The Hunger Games  although we should rather speak of an  unintentional Creator here that person  is casca highbotta he is the dean of the  academy which is the elite school in the  capital he created The Hunger Games as a  theoretical concept that was never meant  to be carried out however an ambitious  doctor at the Academy took the concept  and brought it to the public and thus  casca became known as the face of The  Hunger Games the cruelty involved in  reality and his personal involvement in  it led highbottom to become addicted to  Morphine playing the dean is none other  than Game of Thrones star Peter Dinklage  we couldn't have dreamed of a better  cast for a genius with a tendency  towards self-indulgence in keeping with  a motto I take morphine and I know  things  what would the Hunger Games be without a  flickerman in The Ballad of songbirds  and snakes however his name is not  Caesar but lucretius Lucky flickerman in  the 10th Hunger Games he is not hosting  the entire games yet instead he conducts  the interviews with the mentors and  tributes he is played by Jason  Schwartzman who most recently appeared  in Fargo in the French dispatch whether  there is a family connection between  Caesar flickman and lucretius was never  mentioned in the books  given that the protagonist is from  District 12 again we can assume that  there will be some other characters from  this part of panum as well three more  residents have been confirmed already  number one Billy Tope as Lucy's lover  there is sure to be a lot of possible  conflict with this character especially  considering that she also gets  romantically involved with snow in the  movie Hope is played by Valley of the  boom actor Dakota Shapiro we also get to  meet one of Lucy's band baits mod Ivory  Baird she's played by Von Reilly and  last but not least of course we have the  male tribute Spruce Lucy's counterpart  is portrayed by the Brit George Sumner  who last had a role in the TV series  this is going to hurt  a large part of the tributes has also  been cast already since the tributes are  children the actors are of course  relatively young and for many it is  their first role in a major Hollywood  film mizen from District 4 is played by  Cooper Dillon some of you may know the  German American from the peppercorns a  German Kid series lamina from district 7  is portrayed by Irene Bohm the 18 year  old played in the TV series Babylon  Berlin there she is the sister of the  protagonist Charlotte Ritter the tribute  of district 7 is played by 13 year old  Sophia Sanchez the young American model  has been diagnosed with trismy 21 and  became well known for her video Down  syndrome is not scary the district 10  tributes are played by Luna cues known  from the German TV show Castle Einstein  and Kell brookshite latter was last seen  in the German film The Young Chief  winnetu the final tribute is Reaper from  District 11 played by dimitria Bowl  among the tributes are of course also  the mentors from the capital and the  10th Hunger Games these all come from  the academy the top 24 students have the  honor of being mentors in The Hunger  Games for the female tribute Coral from  District 4 fastest Creed is the mentor  he's played by the British actor Max  Rafael for mizzen it is Persephone price  and she is embodied by Athena Straits  The Young South African with German  background has also made a couple of  appearances on German television lamina  from district 7 is trained by Pliny pup  Harrington he is portrayed by ayomide at  a gun for atagan it is his first  appearance on the big screen then there  is the male tribute from district 7  Treach who gets fipsenia sickle as a  mentor sickle is played by 18 year old  American Amelie hofuro meanwhile damisha  whimsawick is the mentor for the tribute  from District 10 and lysastrada Vickers  is her equivalent to the male tribute  from District 12. the two women are  embodied by Caitlin akan palumi and Zoe  Renee  production unlike most of the cast we  will see a well-known name sitting in  the director's chair as in Catching Fire  Mockingjay Part 1 and Mockingjay Part 2  Francis Lawrence will once again direct  the film for the production the team is  also sticking to the tried and true Nina  Jacobs and Brad Simpson Are Back In  Charge book author Suzanne Collins  herself is even on hand to handle the  screenplay while Michael art who wrote  Star Wars episode 7 the force awakens  and Michael Leslie are both providing  support Leslie wrote the screenplay for  the film adaptation of Macbeth released  in cinemas in 2015. shooting for the  movie is set to begin in the fall of  2022. it'll be shot in Germany filming  will take place primarily in the greater  duesburg heading in and cologne areas  anyone who wanted to be a part of the  film had the chance to apply until  August in fact the makers were looking  for more than 3 000 extras in Germany  alone this is certainly one reason why  so many German actors were cast however  the theatrical release is still some  time away as the release date is  scheduled for November 17 2023 of course  we will be keeping you up to date with  all the news about the production and  cast in our weekly news  needless to say the movie will once  again focus on The Hunger Games 63 years  before Katniss Everdeen PanAm is still  shaken by the Civil War which happened  10 years earlier for 16 year old Lucy  gray as tribute of District 12. it's all  about survival nevertheless her love  affair with her Mentor Corey Elena snow  seems to give her some Advantage during  the competition snow however is pursuing  his own goals he is out to restore the  family's honor after their Fall From  Grace during the riots he certainly has  his chance as a mentor in the course of  The Hunger Games and he soon recognizes  his talents which will later help him  become president in addition we are  already looking forward to the story  around casca highbottom the  unintentional creator of The Hunger  Games whether we will also get to  experience the beginnings through  flashbacks remains to be seen sadly we  haven't had a chance to see any moving  images yet but we did get to see a first  teaser however it only shows a snake and  a bird since it's still almost a year  before the film is released we will have  to wait a little more to get a first  trailer but as always you'll be able to  watch it here on our Channel  well that was it all the information  about the new part of The Hunger Games  but now it's your turn what are you most  excited about the games themselves the  new heroine or maybe the character  development of the future presidents  know let us know Down Below in the  comments and if you like the video  please give it a thumbs up see you next  time  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

